      "statement_ref": "statement:sha256:ca338435533c2af28cf552fbc365ac522350aac1c5115f14fac1c871acb5b4c4",
      "region_ref": "document-region:source-revision:sha256:8dd2afe20c7cfb36bc1372f764b7683962e6acdfac6fe0bfa47554812d4eab00:sentence:20:4144-4192",
      "start_char": 4144,
      "end_char": 4192,
      "literal": "This does leave us, however, with a few puzzles."
    },
    {
      "statement_ref": "statement:sha256:6e56193d6f5e8d604517ff46cf6ac5f5047e11cc41da9a470c48c92f91ceeadf",
      "region_ref": "document-region:source-revision:sha256:8dd2afe20c7cfb36bc1372f764b7683962e6acdfac6fe0bfa47554812d4eab00:sentence:21:4195-4286",
      "start_char": 4195,
      "end_char": 4286,
      "literal": "First, why was this amiable fellow both so successful and so unsuccessful as a \npolitician?"
    },
    {
      "statement_ref": "statement:sha256:d76efa1fe5cdba8a1667110721d87f7ddea97de74e7ab83238fb8c2820824044",
      "region_ref": "document-region:source-revision:sha256:8dd2afe20c7cfb36bc1372f764b7683962e6acdfac6fe0bfa47554812d4eab00:sentence:22:4287-4523",
      "start_char": 4287,
      "end_char": 4523,
      "literal": "It is interesting that Bush’s abilities in winning people over at the per-\nsonal level, which was abundantly in evidence in foreign capitals and on Capitol \nHill, translated so poorly into abilities at the level of mass retail politics."
    }
  ],
  "focus_statement": {
    "statement_ref": "statement:sha256:ba4bc65fd422ec59f357adaedb3b325328d259ca550745d44805f4e068d3e99f",
    "region_ref": "document-region:source-revision:sha256:8dd2afe20c7cfb36bc1372f764b7683962e6acdfac6fe0bfa47554812d4eab00:sentence:23:4526-4693",
    "start_char": 4526,
    "end_char": 4693,
    "literal": "Perhaps he was not really all that outstandingly successful, except in the quali-\nties that recommended him to Ronald Reagan in 1980 as an appropriate vice \npresident."
  },
